<title>USA: EA Engineering names Deieso president, CEO.</title>
<headline>EA Engineering names Deieso president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>EA Engineering, Science and Technology Inc said on Friday it named Donald Deieso president and chief executive.</p>
<p>Deieso joined EA Engineering from Metcalf &amp; Eddy Inc, where he was also president and chief executive.</p>
<p>Loren Jensen, EA Engineering's former chief executive, remains the company's chairman.</p>
<p>EA Engineering is an environmental services company.</p>
